{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38619","headline":"禁林闻晓莺 · 陆扆","name":"禁林闻晓莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙色分层汉，莺声绕上林。\n报花开瑞锦，催柳绽黄金。\n断续随风远，间关送月沈。\n语当温树近，飞觉禁园深。\n绣户惊残梦，瑶池啭好音。\n愿将栖息意，从此沃天心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}